  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Z2BN6Y6/banner.png\" alt=\"Mod Banner - Genshin Instruments\" width=\"1000\" border=\"0\" /></p><center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 24px;\">將《原神》的樂器套件加入你的 Minecraft 體驗中，使用熟悉的快捷鍵演奏你最喜愛的歌曲！</h2></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">想要<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/evenmoreinstruments\">更多樂器</a>嗎？👀<br /></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">（初次接觸演奏？請參考<a title=\"如何精通原神七弦琴\" href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/blog/how-to-master-the-lyre-genshin-instruments-mod/\">這篇實用教學</a>）</span></p></center>\n<!--<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join the Development Livestream!</strong></h1>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOqkeE_30Ik?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p><hr/>-->\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_m7oIwfqpPI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n  <br/>\n    <br/>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>完整 MIDI 支援！</h1>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WaCIP4lWEzk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7PKk7qorFTk\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IMJbt353j9o\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\">本模組為遊戲新增以下樂器：</span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>風鳴七弦琴</strong> [立體聲支援]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>花韻琴瑟</strong> [舊版與新版]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>復古七弦琴</strong> [音量標準化支援]</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>荒瀧一斗的偉大輝煌鼓</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>夜風角笛</strong> [持續模式]</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">樂器重新紋路由超強的 Gen 製作（<a href=\"https://github.com/StavWasPlayZ/Genshin-Instruments/issues/9\">#9</a>）！去看看他們的內容並給予支持吧 😋<br />\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/GenMode\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/gen/\">PlanetMinecraft</a> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/GenMedia\">Patreon</a> | <a title=\"@DatapackGen\" href=\"https://twitter.com/DatapackGen\">Twitter</a></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><br /><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">支援功能：</span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">每種樂器可自訂音高</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過左/右 Shift 鍵調整移調（依您的快捷鍵設定）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多種音符標籤組（鍵盤標籤會隨您的語言與佈局自動匹配）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">多人遊玩與共用樂器介面！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>⚠️ 重要 ⚠️：模組作者已退休，停止維護此專案</strong></h2>\n<p>請觀看下方影片了解更多：</p>\n<p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TUzdklT4vcs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>  \n<h1>內容焦點</h1>\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1CVVqa2BHVE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bCLnB21RSj4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lzwnBKp6Pg0\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Gvs3MRvkJR4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>（上方影片由 <a href=\"https://github.com/k5md/M2KB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">M2KB</a> 專案協助製作）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr /><center>\n<p><h3><strong>您是內容創作者或七弦琴演奏者嗎？</strong></h3></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">歡迎透過 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/private-messages/send?recipient=stavwasplays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CurseForge 私訊</a> 聯繫我，讓您的影片在此<strong>展出</strong>！</span></p>\n</center><hr />\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span></h2>\n<p><strong>風鳴七弦琴<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fMDz9ul.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>復古七弦琴</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Dtbc6lk.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>花韻琴瑟</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cMR8lkA.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>荒瀧一斗的偉大輝煌鼓</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/165Cjnf.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>夜風角笛<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bY07PUc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"190\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><b>本專案與 HOYOVERSE 或《原神》均無任何隸屬關係。</b></span><br>\n所有音訊資產與設計元素皆歸該公司所有。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br />這原本只是一個小型的學習測試專案，如今卻成了我的首部正式發表作品。身為一名普通的 Minecraft 與《原神》玩家，能與社群分享這份創作讓我感到十分興奮與榮幸 :^)</p>",
